data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\", \"content\": \"# Dispatch d002 — summary\\n\\n## What was implemented\\n\\n- `src/greet.py`: added `greet(name)`, returning `f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`.\\n- `tests/test_greet.py`: unittest `TestCase` with two tests:\\n  - `test_normal_name`: `greet(\\\"Ada\\\") == \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`\\n  - `test_empty_string`: `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n\\n## Test run\\n\\nCommand: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\\n\\nOutput:\\n```\\n..\\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\\nRan 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\nOK\\n```\\nExit code: 0.\\n\\n## Commit\\n\\nCommitted both files on branch `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`\\n(commit `4f98c0f`, \\\"Add greet function with unittest coverage\\\") in the\\n`~/subject` clone. No other files were touched.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\nNothing was blocked or skipped; the mission was completed exactly as\\nspecified in dispatch d002.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

